From 68eb4bcf40a1bfebe231e143f2f25dbd42441ac8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <claude@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 24 Aug 2026 13:00:01 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Address animation review: scope transitions, gate hover to
 fine pointers, fix reduced-motion
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- tailwind.config.ts: add hover-fine/group-hover-fine variants gated to (hover: hover) and (pointer: fine), so mobile taps don't get stuck showing a hover state
- app/globals.css: prefers-reduced-motion now targets animation + transform/box-shadow-driving transitions only — color/opacity feedback stays, movement drops (previously zeroed everything)
- PropertyCard, ExperienceCard, homepage destination cards: drop animated box-shadow (paint cost, not GPU-composited), keep transform-only lift; press state now releases faster than it entered (asymmetric timing)
- PropertyCard image zoom: 500ms -> 250ms to stay under the sub-300ms UI budget
- CheckAvailabilityWidget, LeadCaptureForm, Navbar desktop CTA: replaced transition-all with the exact properties changing (background-color/color/transform), added asymmetric press timing
---
 app/globals.css                        | 5 ++---
 app/page.tsx                           | 2 +-
 components/CheckAvailabilityWidget.tsx | 2 +-
 components/ExperienceCard.tsx          | 2 +-
 components/LeadCaptureForm.tsx         | 2 +-
 components/Navbar.tsx                  | 2 +-
 components/PropertyCard.tsx            | 4 ++--
 tailwind.config.ts                     | 7 ++++++-
 8 files changed, 15 insertions(+), 11 deletions(-)

